OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786454321
OL,3,C'It's too far', families fear longer
OL,4,Cjourneys could put babies lives at risk
OL,6,FFamilies expecting babies in Devon are
OL,7,Fworried about new journey times which
OL,8,Fthey believe could put them and their
OL,9,Fbabies at a higher risk.
OL,11,FFrom Tuesday August 11 birthing
OL,12,Fservices at North Devon District
OL,13,FHospital in Barnstable have been
OL,14,Fsuspended because of concerns about
OL,15,F'unsafe levels of medical staffing'.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
