FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786454321
OL,3,C'It's too far', families fear longer
OL,4,Cjourneys could put babies lives at risk
OL,6,FThere was hopes that the closure of
OL,7,Fthe unit - initially announced on July
OL,8,F27th - might have been averted but
OL,9,Fdespite 'tireless efforts' the
OL,10,Fdecision was made to suspend services
OL,11,Ftemporarily.
OL,13,FAlisha Aston, who was due to give
OL,14,Fbirth to her second child at North
OL,15,FDevon District hospital, said she
OL,16,Ffeared her underlying health condition
OL,17,Fcould put her baby's life at risk.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786454321
OL,3,C'It's too far', families fear longer
OL,4,Cjourneys could put babies lives at risk
OL,6,FShe will now have to give birth at the
OL,7,FRoyal Devon and Exeter hospital, which
OL,8,Fis a much longer journey from her
OL,9,Fmother's home near South Molton.
OL,11,FThe birth of Alisha's first child,
OL,12,Fwent smoothy but also revealed a
OL,13,Fhealth condition. She fears the
OL,14,Fincreased journey time could put the
OL,15,Fhealth of her baby at risk.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786454321
OL,3,C'It's too far', families fear longer
OL,4,Cjourneys could put babies lives at risk
OL,6,F"I have Group B Strep and if the baby
OL,7,Fis born too early, before the chance
OL,8,Fto give me antibiotics through an IV,
OL,9,Fthere is a very high chance the baby
OL,10,Fwill be born with sepsis, pneumonia
OL,11,Fand meningitis.
OL,13,F"That is a massive worry because
OL,14,Fnewborn babies haven't developed their
OL,15,Fimmune systems and that would mean a
OL,16,Fstay in neonatal intensive care.
OL,18,F"I think it's awful, it's so worrying,
OL,19,Fit has caused so many levels of
OL,20,Fanxiety for so many mums, and I think
OL,21,Fit's terrible.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786454321
OL,3,C'It's too far', families fear longer
OL,4,Cjourneys could put babies lives at risk
OL,6,F"One thing pregnant people don't need
OL,7,Fis stress, and this whole thing has
OL,8,Fcaused a lot of stress."
OL,10,FAlisha's mother says they will have to
OL,11,Fpractice the journey to Exeter
OL,12,Fhospital, for when Alisha's due date
OL,13,Farrives.
OL,15,FShe said, "We are going to do a dummy
OL,16,Frun to find the hospital and the
OL,17,Fmaternity ward."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
