OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786454321
OL,3,C'It's too far', families fear longer
OL,4,Cjourneys could put babies lives at risk
OL,6,FAnother family with equal concerns
OL,7,Fabout the increased journey time to
OL,8,Falternative hospitals, are Callum and
OL,9,FLaura Adams.
OL,11,FTheir original journey time would have
OL,12,Fbeen 15 minutes, but it will take them
OL,13,Fover an hour.
OL,15,FLaura revealed she first heard of the
OL,16,Fannouncement via social media, adding:
OL,17,F"The first thing we did was panic, it
OL,18,Fmeans we will have a really long drive
OL,19,Fbecause we have no nearby hospitals.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786454321
OL,3,C'It's too far', families fear longer
OL,4,Cjourneys could put babies lives at risk
OL,6,F"So that means a long time in the car
OL,7,Fand a bit of uncertainty about what
OL,8,Fit's going to look like on our birth
OL,9,Fday.
OL,11,F"If things are going askew, the
OL,12,Fdifference between 15 minutes and an
OL,13,Fhour could be the difference in
OL,14,Fsomething quite severe happening."
OL,16,FCallum added that some of their close
OL,17,Ffriends who have recently had babies,
OL,18,F'couldn't have imagined this situation
OL,19,Fhappening to them'.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786454321
OL,3,C'It's too far', families fear longer
OL,4,Cjourneys could put babies lives at risk
OL,6,FHe added: "Some of their babies
OL,7,Fwouldn't have survived if they had to
OL,8,Fdrive over an hour to hospital, in an
OL,9,Femergency, it's too far."
OL,11,FDr Vanessa Purday, Chief Medical
OL,12,FOfficer Royal Devon University
OL,13,FHealthcare NHS Foundation Trust: "We
OL,14,Fhave worked tirelessly to avoid having
OL,15,Fto suspend services, but sadly we have
OL,16,Fnot been able to deliver the safe
OL,17,Flevel of medical staffing to keep the
OL,18,Fservice open, so we have made the
OL,19,Fdecision to suspend services
OL,20,Ftemporarily.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786454321
OL,3,C'It's too far', families fear longer
OL,4,Cjourneys could put babies lives at risk
OL,6,F"We have contacted all women and
OL,7,Fbirthing people who are expecting over
OL,8,F34 weeks, and all those who are
OL,9,Fclinically vulnerable or who have
OL,10,Fparticular socio-economic needs.
OL,12,F"We have also worked with our partners
OL,13,Fin the South West to try and make sure
OL,14,Fwe are using any additional workforce,
OL,15,Fwe've worked with locum agencies to
OL,16,Ftry to provide extra staffing.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786454321
OL,3,C'It's too far', families fear longer
OL,4,Cjourneys could put babies lives at risk
OL,6,F"We continue to have a really robust
OL,7,Fplan to safely re-open and that is our
OL,8,Fpriority, we recognise the need for
OL,9,Fwomen and birthing people in North
OL,10,FDevon that they have access to a
OL,11,Fmaternity service here. This is a
OL,12,Fdecision we made has not been taken
OL,13,Flightly."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
